(label "VDD3P3" (at 198.12 327.66 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "23e12f70-f4f8-5afc-b84f-8f522bcd1ccc"))
(text "jank chip (hardware/chip/README.md). POWER: J3 POWER IN (a gear's MIDI OUT / THRU via a TRS-to-DIN type A adaptor): ring (DIN 4) and tip (DIN 5) each through 47 ohm and a B5819W into VSYS, sleeve (DIN 2) = GND. USB VBUS joins VSYS through D3 and R5 4.7 ohm." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "fe4f0b65-6320-5cb0-867c-1b538a92088c"))
(text "VSYS: C1 + C2 (2 x 1000 uF) and C3. U2 TPS62842 makes +3V3 (R7 51k), enabled by BUCK_EN = U3 (VSYS above ~4.16 V rising, 4.0 V falling) OR VBUS OR PWR_HOLD (GPIO4), through D4 / D5; C4 + R6 keep it ~1 s after they drop." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 16.509999999999998 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "24dbdb52-8e94-5c73-84a6-2019b0744eb6"))
(text "MIDI OUT J2 (to a gear's MIDI IN, type A): ring = +3V3 through R14 33 ohm, tip = MIDI_TX (GPIO21) through R15 10 ohm, sleeve = GND. J5 / J6: DIN sockets on the bottom, in parallel (DNP, hand-soldered; a cable can go on their pads too)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8bb1378a-e48c-5871-a0ea-6dbadddcc4ff"))
(text "Pins: GPIO21 MIDI_TX, GPIO38 LED, GPIO0 BOOT, GPIO1 VBANK_ADC (VSYS / 2), GPIO2 VBUS_SENSE (VBUS / 2), GPIO4 PWR_HOLD, GPIO19 / 20 USB D- / D+, GPIO10 MIDI2_TX (Q1: the POWER IN port as a second MIDI OUT, USB power only). GPIO3, 45, 46 (strapping) open: internal defaults (3.3 V flash, SPI boot)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 24.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "71481651-aec2-5d2b-9ad6-d7270196ef0e"))
(text "U1 ESP32-S3FN8: VDDA C11-C13; VDD3P3 through L2 2 nH (C14-C17 before, C18 after); VDD3P3_CPU C19, VDD3P3_RTC C20; VDD_SPI C21 + C22; CHIP_PU R8 10k / C7 1u; Y1 40 MHz, C9 / C10 10 pF, R17 0 ohm on XTAL_P (XIAO ESP32S3 v1.2 values)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 27.939999999999998 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "884b7be6-0ffb-56f7-9cb9-2debf9244356"))
(text "RF: LNA_IN, C23 1 pF shunt, L3 3.3 nH series, C24 shunt (DNP), the 50 ohm line (net RF), C25 (DNP), R18 0 ohm, C26 (DNP), AE1 chip antenna. External antenna instead: R18 moved to R19 (DNP), J4 u.FL (DNP). Matching values UNTUNED (no VNA)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 31.75 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "fd5c2cbf-0db1-52f6-816a-730984011966"))
(sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
